# The contact form no longer needs any NEXT_PUBLIC_* / client-side env var —
# it posts to the site's own same-origin /api/contact endpoint (a Cloudflare
# Pages Function). That function's configuration is server-side only; see
# .dev.vars.example for local development and README.md for Cloudflare Pages
# dashboard setup (BREVO_API_KEY, CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL).
